      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transportation Nawabganj Unnao</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When arranging bike transportation in Nawabganj, meticulous preparation of legal and logistical documentation is the single most critical factor in ensuring a seamless, compliant, and secure delivery.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Failure to present the correct paperwork at the point of pickup can result in immediate refusal of service, significant delays, or, in the worst case, the vehicle being held by local authorities.</span></li></ul>
<p>To avoid these complications, shippers must ensure that every document is current, legible, and ready for inspection by the IBA-approved transport partner before the bike is loaded.</p>

<h3>Core Legal Documents for Vehicle Dispatch</h3>
<p>The foundation of any legal bike transit begins with proof of ownership and roadworthiness. You must provide the following documents in original and photocopy form:</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self-Attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Registration Certificate must be clearly legible. The term "self-attested" means you must sign the photocopy and write "Verified Original" in your own handwriting. This certifies to the transporter that you are the authorized owner and legally permitted to dispatch the vehicle.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>An expired or mismatched RC will halt the entire process</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A valid Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate is mandatory in Nawabganj and across Uttar Pradesh. Transporters are legally required to verify that the vehicle is not emitting excessive pollutants. Ensure the certificate is not expired; even a one-day lapse can lead to the bike being rejected at the depot.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">While the RC proves ownership, the insurance certificate proves legal liability. The third-party insurance policy must be active. If your current policy is nearing expiry, renew it immediately before scheduling the pickup to avoid administrative hurdles.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h3>Logistics and Financial Protection</h3>
<p>Once the legal basics are cleared, the focus shifts to the commercial and physical safety of the bike. This is where the transporter's operational documents and your financial safeguards come into play.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>IBA-Approved Consignment Bilty:</strong> The bilty is the official waybill that tracks your bike from Nawabganj to its final destination. It must be issued by an Interstate Bargain Association (IBA) approved carrier. This document serves as your receipt and the primary legal instrument for claiming compensation in case of loss or damage. Ensure the bilty number is noted clearly and shared with all parties involved in the delivery chain.</li>
</ul>

<h3>100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Standard third-party insurance does not cover the full value of your bike in the event of an accident during transit. Therefore, it is essential to opt for <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. This specialized policy covers the bike against fire, theft, and physical damage while it is on the truck.</p>
<p>By declaring the true market value of your bike, you ensure that if any incident occurs, you receive full compensation for the actual worth of the vehicle, not just a partial sum. This is non-negotiable for high-value motorcycles.</p>
<p>By adhering to this strict documentation protocol, you eliminate risk and guarantee that your bike transportation in Nawabganj proceeds with maximum security and legal compliance.</p></div>
