	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Flexible Space:</strong> Open trailers provide ample space to accommodate larger bikes and customized parts. You can easily inspect and access your belongings while transporting.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Affordable:</strong> Open trailers are generally more cost-effective compared to enclosed carriers, making them a popular choice for those on a budget.</span></li>
